    <mxCell id="note" value="E-1 — the value written to L35 must equal the registry index digest for the tag. A hand-edited or copied digest still passes the format check, so EV-06 must be read, not skimmed. Registry GC or mirror rotation after merge → emergency path §10.3 / FSD §13.7.8." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=9;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;size=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
